		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  [RESOLU] Calcul de pourcentage]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=18369#p18369"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<div class="codebox"><pre><code>test=# select materiaux, count(*) as total, count(*) / (sum(count(*)) over())*100 as pourcentage from matable group by materiaux;
 materiaux | total |        pourcentage         
-----------+-------+-------------------------
 fonte     |     5 | 62.50000000000000000000
 pvc       |     3 | 37.50000000000000000000
(2 rows)</code></pre></div>]]></content>
